{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I really want you to play this typing game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yes, you just need to type as instructed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There's no need to think at all.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror typing game Dyping with over 350,000 plays will offer a dialed-up horror experience as Dyping Escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Type your way to death.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The warped sentences given by The Eyes turn real and assail those who typed them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Please kill me.&quot; If you type this, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/76767f8d43737744cac7ab7093dd697e.poster.avif?t=1764143090\" width=606 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/76767f8d43737744cac7ab7093dd697e.webm?t=1764143090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/76767f8d43737744cac7ab7093dd697e.mp4?t=1764143090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You must go beyond the game... and destroy it from the outside.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unreasonable, arbitrary death is unavoidable in this game, by normal means, that is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems you have no choice but to type and die once the macabre sentence is given...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you might be able to open the Settings screen, at least.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/93be4ac9ae5d5e9171081f6b8621f0d2.poster.avif?t=1764143090\" width=606 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/93be4ac9ae5d5e9171081f6b8621f0d2.webm?t=1764143090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/93be4ac9ae5d5e9171081f6b8621f0d2.mp4?t=1764143090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3406810?t=1764143090","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764143090","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/d80962a7ecdffc59f06f0967ffa275911204d3f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764143090","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/d80962a7ecdffc59f06f0967ffa275911204d3f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764143090","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I really want you to play this typing game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yes, you just need to type as instructed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There's no need to think at all.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror typing game Dyping with over 350,000 plays will offer a dialed-up horror experience as Dyping Escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Type your way to death.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The warped sentences given by The Eyes turn real and assail those who typed them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Please kill me.&quot; If you type this, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/76767f8d43737744cac7ab7093dd697e.poster.avif?t=1764143090\" width=606 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/76767f8d43737744cac7ab7093dd697e.webm?t=1764143090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/76767f8d43737744cac7ab7093dd697e.mp4?t=1764143090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You must go beyond the game... and destroy it from the outside.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unreasonable, arbitrary death is unavoidable in this game, by normal means, that is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems you have no choice but to type and die once the macabre sentence is given...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you might be able to open the Settings screen, at least.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/93be4ac9ae5d5e9171081f6b8621f0d2.poster.avif?t=1764143090\" width=606 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/93be4ac9ae5d5e9171081f6b8621f0d2.webm?t=1764143090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/93be4ac9ae5d5e9171081f6b8621f0d2.mp4?t=1764143090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Heaviside Creations"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"descr